{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的叙事压缩牺牲了少数心理转折的完整性，尤其S05争得疲惫才逐渐放下、S12不再责怪自己离开的心理变化，X交代得更清楚。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的加亮词能让观众迅速抓住每段叙事的核心，感受词又按音乐时点出现，不必同时消化整片短词，扫屏时更容易把握重点。尤其Y对音乐织体、旋律变化、力度起伏和情绪转折的描述更具体，能让观众感到人物心理与音乐发展彼此呼应，前后形成一条连续的体验。X的完整叙述在解释人物动机和心理因果方面更有优势，但右侧短词较容易成为彼此分散的注释，整体的音乐细节和层次感不如Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "72d58ab8-cae5-48c4-a8d4-9d3ead4e4ce4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T201232280528Z", "elapsed_seconds": 104.39, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T20:14:16.685317+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "df587c14c1e1b5304ac4694d31dda364cd318ff4f13157d44ddb5e11210b435f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_w